⚙️ How this changes Naya's execution

From now on, when something gets difficult, I'm not just going to ask:

"What's wrong with this piece?"

I'm going to internally ask:

🔬 ZOOM IN

What exactly is happening?

🌲 ZOOM OUT

What larger system is this part of?

👀 LOOK ALL AROUND

What perspective am I missing?

🔑 INVARIANT

What must remain true regardless of implementation route?

🛣️ ROUTES

